[[Diary Archive]]

:: Diary Archive

/*
exporting the diary needs to be an option in case someone plays long enough for it to become close to 5MB
hopefully other things (to be)done to keep it from getting to that point will make this mostly unnecesary(short property names, rounding numbers, removing stats from older entries and possibly even removing less important older entries)

*/

<<textarea "_export" $diary >> <<linkappend "">>Are you sure? <<link "yes|">><<set $diary to _>><</link>><</linkappend>>
Paste your old diary here:<<textbox "_diaryimport" "" >> to 
<<link "read it">><<set $diary to _>><</link>><br>
<br>




